<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="color-scheme" content="dark"><meta name="darkreader-lock"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Control</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"><link rel='stylesheet' href='/collective.css'><link rel='stylesheet' href='/runtime.css'><link rel='stylesheet' href='/workspace.css'><link rel='stylesheet' href='/navigation.css'><script type='module' src='/tool-window/chat-bootstrap.js'></script></head>
<body>
<aside class="sidebar">
  <a href="/" class="brand"><span class="brand-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌘</span>CONTROL<span class="version">/ 0.1</span></a>
  <div class="workspace"><span class="dot"></span><div>Local workspace<small>control.local</small></div></div>
  <div class="nav-label">WORKSPACE</div>
  <nav aria-label="Workspace"><a href='/dms'><span aria-hidden='true'>⌁</span><span>DMs</span></a><a href='/?view=agents'><span aria-hidden='true'>⌁</span><span>Bots</span></a><a href='/knowledge'><span aria-hidden='true'>▤</span><span>Knowledge</span></a><a href='/?view=rooms'><span aria-hidden='true'>#</span><span>Rooms</span></a><a href='/?view=tools'><span aria-hidden='true'>⊞</span><span>Tools</span></a><a href='/dna'><span aria-hidden='true'>◈</span><span>DNA</span></a><a href='/personas'><span aria-hidden='true'>◇</span><span>Personas</span></a><a href='/?view=monitor'><span aria-hidden='true'>▥</span><span>Usage</span></a><a href='/?view=manage' aria-current='location'><span aria-hidden='true'>⚙</span><span>Manage</span></a></nav>
  <div class="sidebar-bottom"><div class="profile"><span class="avatar">OP</span><div>Operator<small>Local access</small></div></div></div>
</aside>
<div class="shell">
  <header><div class="header-left"><a class="new-chat-link" href="/dms?new=1"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>New DM</a><span class="header-context">Manage<span class='slash' aria-hidden='true'>/</span>Models &amp; providers</span></div><div class="header-right"><a class='discuss-page' href='/dms?discuss=providers'>Discuss design ↗</a><a class="node-link" href="/?view=nodes"><span class="node-indicator" aria-hidden="true"></span>Local</a></div></header>
  <div class="body-grid with-section-nav"><aside class='section-navigation'><h2>Manage</h2><nav aria-label='Manage'><a href='/?view=nodes'>Nodes</a><a href='/?view=authority'>Permissions</a><a href='/?view=providers' aria-current='page'>Models &amp; providers</a><a href='/?view=discord-access'>Discord access</a><a href='/?view=integrations'>Integrations</a></nav></aside><main><div class='providers-page' data-live-src='/providers/live' data-live-every='5'><h2>Models &amp; providers</h2><p id='saved' class='provider-saved save-confirmation' role='status'>Saved.</p><section class='provider-section' aria-labelledby='agent-models-heading'><h3 id='agent-models-heading'>Agent models</h3><p class='provider-description'>Select the default for new DMs and spawned agents.</p><h4 class='model-group'>Integrations</h4><div class='model-list' aria-label='Integration models'><section class='model-row'><form method='post' action='/providers'><input type='hidden' name='action' value='select'><input type='hidden' name='provider' value='claude'><input type='hidden' name='model' value='claude-&lt;big&gt;'><button class='model-choice' aria-pressed='false'><span class='model-dot' aria-hidden='true'></span><span class='model-name'><span class='model-id' title='claude-&lt;big&gt;'>claude-&lt;big&gt;</span><span class='model-provider'>Anthropic / Claude Code</span></span></button></form><details class='model-edit'><summary aria-label='Edit Anthropic / Claude Code model claude-&lt;big&gt;'>Edit</summary><div class='model-edit-body'><form method='post' action='/providers'><input type='hidden' name='action' value='edit'><input type='hidden' name='provider' value='claude'><input type='hidden' name='old_model' value='claude-&lt;big&gt;'><label>Model ID<input name='model' required maxlength='100' value='claude-&lt;big&gt;' spellcheck='false' autocapitalize='none'></label><button class='primary'>Save model</button></form><form class='model-capacity' method='post' action='/providers'><input type='hidden' name='action' value='capacity'><input type='hidden' name='provider' value='claude'><input type='hidden' name='model' value='claude-&lt;big&gt;'><h4>Context capacity</h4><p class='provider-description'>Leave context tokens empty to use the provider policy. Instructions that cannot fit are reported, never truncated.</p><div class='provider-fields'><label>Context tokens<input name='context_tokens' type='number' min='1' placeholder='Unknown' value='200000'></label><label>Output token reserve<input name='output_tokens' type='number' min='1' value='8192'></label><label>Provider/tool token reserve<input name='overhead_tokens' type='number' min='0' value='4096'></label></div><p class='provider-description'>Input bytes conservatively count as tokens.</p><button class='primary'>Save capacity</button></form></div></details></section><section class='model-row'><form method='post' action='/providers'><input type='hidden' name='action' value='select'><input type='hidden' name='provider' value='grok'><input type='hidden' name='model' value='grok-4'><button class='model-choice' aria-pressed='false'><span class='model-dot' aria-hidden='true'></span><span class='model-name'><span class='model-id' title='grok-4'>grok-4</span><span class='model-provider'>xAI / Grok Build</span></span></button></form><details class='model-edit'><summary aria-label='Edit xAI / Grok Build model grok-4'>Edit</summary><div class='model-edit-body'><form method='post' action='/providers'><input type='hidden' name='action' value='edit'><input type='hidden' name='provider' value='grok'><input type='hidden' name='old_model' value='grok-4'><label>Model ID<input name='model' required maxlength='100' value='grok-4' spellcheck='false' autocapitalize='none'></label><button class='primary'>Save model</button></form><form class='model-capacity' method='post' action='/providers'><input type='hidden' name='action' value='capacity'><input type='hidden' name='provider' value='grok'><input type='hidden' name='model' value='grok-4'><h4>Context capacity</h4><p class='provider-description'>Leave context tokens empty to use the provider policy. Instructions that cannot fit are reported, never truncated.</p><div class='provider-fields'><label>Context tokens<input name='context_tokens' type='number' min='1' placeholder='Unknown' value=''></label><label>Output token reserve<input name='output_tokens' type='number' min='1' value='2048'></label><label>Provider/tool token reserve<input name='overhead_tokens' type='number' min='0' value='4096'></label></div><p class='provider-description'>Input bytes conservatively count as tokens.</p><button class='primary'>Save capacity</button></form></div></details></section></div><h4 class='model-group'>Accounts</h4><p class='provider-description'>Select one with <code>backend+account:model</code>. Add one with <code>control accounts add BACKEND NAME</code>, or <code>--kind api-key</code> for an API key, which bills per use.</p><table class='persona-table provider-accounts'><thead><tr><th>Account</th><th>Kind</th><th>Login</th><th>State</th><th>Sign in with</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>codex+default</code> <span class='model-default'>Default</span></td><td>subscription</td><td>Signed in</td><td>Enabled</td><td>codex login (on the host)</td></tr><tr><td><code>claude+default</code> <span class='model-default'>Default</span></td><td>subscription</td><td>Signed in</td><td>Enabled</td><td>control claude login</td></tr><tr><td><code>grok+default</code> <span class='model-default'>Default</span></td><td>subscription</td><td>Signed in</td><td>Enabled</td><td>control grok login</td></tr><tr><td><code>antigravity+default</code> <span class='model-default'>Default</span></td><td>subscription</td><td>Signed in</td><td>Enabled</td><td>control antigravity login</td></tr></tbody></table><h4 class='model-group'>Local</h4><div class='model-list' aria-label='Local models'><section class='model-row'><form method='post' action='/providers'><input type='hidden' name='action' value='select'><input type='hidden' name='provider' value='local'><input type='hidden' name='model' value='qwen-agent'><button class='model-choice' aria-pressed='true'><span class='model-dot' aria-hidden='true'></span><span class='model-name'><span class='model-id' title='qwen-agent'>qwen-agent</span><span class='model-provider'>Local endpoint · http://127.0.0.1:8081/v1</span></span><span class='model-default'>Default</span></button></form><details class='model-edit'><summary aria-label='Edit model qwen-agent'>Edit</summary><div class='model-edit-body'><dl class='model-metadata'><div><dt>Model</dt><dd>qwen-agent &lt;model&gt;</dd></div><div><dt>Serves</dt><dd>summaries · text generation · agent turns</dd></div><div><dt>Context tokens</dt><dd>32768</dd></div><div><dt>Output reserve</dt><dd>1024 tokens</dd></div></dl><p class='model-stats provider-description' data-live='qwen-agent' data-live-fallback='Live statistics unavailable.' aria-live='polite'>Reading live statistics…</p><details class='model-revision'><summary>Weights / runtime revision</summary><code>rev &amp; 1</code></details><form method='post' action='/providers'><input type='hidden' name='action' value='text-edit'><input type='hidden' name='id' value='qwen-agent'><div class='provider-fields'><label>Model ID or server alias<input name='model' required maxlength='100' value='qwen-agent &lt;model&gt;'></label><label>Private endpoint<input name='url' placeholder='http://127.0.0.1:8081/v1' value='http://127.0.0.1:8081/v1'></label><label>Weights/runtime revision<input name='revision' required maxlength='256' value='rev &amp; 1'></label><label>Declared context tokens<input name='context_tokens' type='number' min='1024' value='32768'></label><label>Output token reserve<input name='output_tokens' type='number' min='1' value='1024'></label><label>Input byte ceiling<input name='input_bytes' type='number' min='1' max='1048576' value='28000'></label><label>Output byte ceiling<input name='output_bytes' type='number' min='1' max='65536' value='8192'></label><label>Request timeout seconds<input name='timeout_seconds' type='number' min='1' max='86400' value='1800'></label></div><div class='provider-fields'><label>Thinking in agent turns<select name='thinking'><option value='off'>off</option><option value='minimal'>minimal</option><option value='low' selected>low</option><option value='medium'>medium</option><option value='high'>high</option></select><small>For reasoning models (Qwen3 family). Control adapts it per step around this level; at most half the output reserve goes to thinking. Summaries never think.</small></label></div><label class='summary-toggle'><input name='tools' type='checkbox' checked><span><strong>Serves tool calls</strong><small>Local endpoint only. Declares OpenAI-style tool calls (llama.cpp <code>--jinja</code>): the model is then listed under Agent models, can be the default, and is selectable as <code>local:NAME</code>.</small></span></label><button class='primary'>Save model</button></form><form class='model-capacity' method='post' action='/providers'><input type='hidden' name='action' value='text-remove'><input type='hidden' name='id' value='qwen-agent'><button class='provider-secondary' aria-label='Remove model qwen-agent'>Remove</button></form></div></details></section></div><details class='model-add'><summary>+ New model</summary><form method='post' action='/providers'><input type='hidden' name='action' value='add'><h4>Integration</h4><div class='provider-fields'><label>Provider<select name='provider'><option value='codex'>OpenAI / Codex</option><option value='claude'>Anthropic / Claude Code</option><option value='grok'>xAI / Grok Build</option><option value='antigravity'>Google / Antigravity CLI</option></select></label><label>Model ID<input name='model' required maxlength='100' placeholder='gpt-6.1-sol, sonnet, grok-4.7, gemini-4-neon-medium' spellcheck='false' autocapitalize='none'></label></div><button class='primary'>Add model</button></form><form method='post' action='/providers'><input type='hidden' name='action' value='text-add'><h4>Local endpoint</h4><div class='provider-fields'><input type='hidden' name='adapter' value='endpoint'><label>Name<input name='id' required maxlength='100' placeholder='qwen-local'></label><label>Model ID or server alias<input name='model' required maxlength='100' value=''></label><label>Private endpoint<input name='url' placeholder='http://127.0.0.1:8081/v1' value=''></label><label>Weights/runtime revision<input name='revision' required maxlength='256' value=''></label><label>Declared context tokens<input name='context_tokens' type='number' min='1024' value='32768'></label><label>Output token reserve<input name='output_tokens' type='number' min='1' value='1024'></label><label>Input byte ceiling<input name='input_bytes' type='number' min='1' max='1048576' value='28000'></label><label>Output byte ceiling<input name='output_bytes' type='number' min='1' max='65536' value='8192'></label><label>Request timeout seconds<input name='timeout_seconds' type='number' min='1' max='86400' value='1800'></label></div><div class='provider-fields'><label>Thinking in agent turns<select name='thinking'><option value='off'>off</option><option value='minimal'>minimal</option><option value='low'>low</option><option value='medium' selected>medium</option><option value='high'>high</option></select><small>For reasoning models (Qwen3 family). Control adapts it per step around this level; at most half the output reserve goes to thinking. Summaries never think.</small></label></div><label class='summary-toggle'><input name='tools' type='checkbox' checked><span><strong>Serves tool calls</strong><small>Local endpoint only. Declares OpenAI-style tool calls (llama.cpp <code>--jinja</code>): the model is then listed under Agent models, can be the default, and is selectable as <code>local:NAME</code>.</small></span></label><button class='primary'>Add local model</button></form></details></section><section class='provider-section' aria-labelledby='summary-models-heading'><details class='model-add summary-models'><summary id='summary-models-heading'>Summary models (2)</summary><p class='provider-description'>Summaries and <code>control_model_generate</code> only; a local endpoint that serves tool calls is listed under Agent models.</p><div class='model-list' aria-label='Summary models'><section class='model-row'><div class='model-choice model-static'><span class='model-name'><span class='model-id' title='summary-small'>summary-small</span><span class='model-provider'>Local endpoint · http://127.0.0.1:8082/v1</span></span><span class='model-default'>Compactor</span></div><details class='model-edit'><summary aria-label='Edit model summary-small'>Edit</summary><div class='model-edit-body'><dl class='model-metadata'><div><dt>Model</dt><dd>summary-small &lt;model&gt;</dd></div><div><dt>Serves</dt><dd>summaries · text generation</dd></div><div><dt>Context tokens</dt><dd>32768</dd></div><div><dt>Output reserve</dt><dd>1024 tokens</dd></div></dl><p class='model-stats provider-description' data-live='summary-small' data-live-fallback='Live statistics unavailable.' aria-live='polite'>Reading live statistics…</p><details class='model-revision'><summary>Weights / runtime revision</summary><code>rev &amp; 1</code></details><form method='post' action='/providers'><input type='hidden' name='action' value='text-edit'><input type='hidden' name='id' value='summary-small'><div class='provider-fields'><label>Model ID or server alias<input name='model' required maxlength='100' value='summary-small &lt;model&gt;'></label><label>Private endpoint<input name='url' placeholder='http://127.0.0.1:8081/v1' value='http://127.0.0.1:8082/v1'></label><label>Weights/runtime revision<input name='revision' required maxlength='256' value='rev &amp; 1'></label><label>Declared context tokens<input name='context_tokens' type='number' min='1024' value='32768'></label><label>Output token reserve<input name='output_tokens' type='number' min='1' value='1024'></label><label>Input byte ceiling<input name='input_bytes' type='number' min='1' max='1048576' value='28000'></label><label>Output byte ceiling<input name='output_bytes' type='number' min='1' max='65536' value='8192'></label><label>Request timeout seconds<input name='timeout_seconds' type='number' min='1' max='86400' value='1800'></label></div><div class='provider-fields'><label>Thinking in agent turns<select name='thinking'><option value='off'>off</option><option value='minimal'>minimal</option><option value='low'>low</option><option value='medium' selected>medium</option><option value='high'>high</option></select><small>For reasoning models (Qwen3 family). Control adapts it per step around this level; at most half the output reserve goes to thinking. Summaries never think.</small></label></div><label class='summary-toggle'><input name='tools' type='checkbox'><span><strong>Serves tool calls</strong><small>Local endpoint only. Declares OpenAI-style tool calls (llama.cpp <code>--jinja</code>): the model is then listed under Agent models, can be the default, and is selectable as <code>local:NAME</code>.</small></span></label><button class='primary'>Save model</button></form><form class='model-capacity' method='post' action='/providers'><input type='hidden' name='action' value='text-remove'><input type='hidden' name='id' value='summary-small'><button class='provider-secondary' aria-label='Remove model summary-small'>Remove</button></form></div></details></section><section class='model-row'><div class='model-choice model-static'><span class='model-name'><span class='model-id' title='claude-summary'>claude-summary</span><span class='model-provider'>Anthropic / Claude Code · claude-summary &lt;model&gt;</span></span></div><details class='model-edit'><summary aria-label='Edit model claude-summary'>Edit</summary><div class='model-edit-body'><dl class='model-metadata'><div><dt>Model</dt><dd>claude-summary &lt;model&gt;</dd></div><div><dt>Serves</dt><dd>summaries · text generation</dd></div><div><dt>Context tokens</dt><dd>32768</dd></div><div><dt>Output reserve</dt><dd>1024 tokens</dd></div></dl><details class='model-revision'><summary>Weights / runtime revision</summary><code>rev &amp; 1</code></details><form method='post' action='/providers'><input type='hidden' name='action' value='text-edit'><input type='hidden' name='id' value='claude-summary'><div class='provider-fields'><label>Model ID or server alias<input name='model' required maxlength='100' value='claude-summary &lt;model&gt;'></label><label>Weights/runtime revision<input name='revision' required maxlength='256' value='rev &amp; 1'></label><label>Declared context tokens<input name='context_tokens' type='number' min='1024' value='32768'></label><label>Output token reserve<input name='output_tokens' type='number' min='1' value='1024'></label><label>Input byte ceiling<input name='input_bytes' type='number' min='1' max='1048576' value='28000'></label><label>Output byte ceiling<input name='output_bytes' type='number' min='1' max='65536' value='8192'></label><label>Request timeout seconds<input name='timeout_seconds' type='number' min='1' max='86400' value='1800'></label></div><button class='primary'>Save model</button></form><form class='model-capacity' method='post' action='/providers'><input type='hidden' name='action' value='text-remove'><input type='hidden' name='id' value='claude-summary'><button class='provider-secondary' aria-label='Remove model claude-summary'>Remove</button></form></div></details></section></div><form method='post' action='/providers'><input type='hidden' name='action' value='text-add'><h4>New summary model</h4><div class='provider-fields'><label>Adapter<select name='adapter'><option value='endpoint'>Local endpoint</option><option value='codex'>Codex CLI</option><option value='claude'>Claude CLI</option><option value='grok'>Grok CLI</option><option value='antigravity'>Antigravity CLI</option></select></label><label>Name<input name='id' required maxlength='100' placeholder='qwen-local'></label><label>Model ID or server alias<input name='model' required maxlength='100' value=''></label><label>Private endpoint (leave empty for CLI)<input name='url' placeholder='http://127.0.0.1:8081/v1' value=''></label><label>Weights/runtime revision<input name='revision' required maxlength='256' value=''></label><label>Declared context tokens<input name='context_tokens' type='number' min='1024' value='32768'></label><label>Output token reserve<input name='output_tokens' type='number' min='1' value='1024'></label><label>Input byte ceiling<input name='input_bytes' type='number' min='1' max='1048576' value='28000'></label><label>Output byte ceiling<input name='output_bytes' type='number' min='1' max='65536' value='8192'></label><label>Request timeout seconds<input name='timeout_seconds' type='number' min='1' max='86400' value='1800'></label></div><div class='provider-fields'><label>Thinking in agent turns<select name='thinking'><option value='off'>off</option><option value='minimal'>minimal</option><option value='low'>low</option><option value='medium' selected>medium</option><option value='high'>high</option></select><small>For reasoning models (Qwen3 family). Control adapts it per step around this level; at most half the output reserve goes to thinking. Summaries never think.</small></label></div><label class='summary-toggle'><input name='tools' type='checkbox'><span><strong>Serves tool calls</strong><small>Local endpoint only. Declares OpenAI-style tool calls (llama.cpp <code>--jinja</code>): the model is then listed under Agent models, can be the default, and is selectable as <code>local:NAME</code>.</small></span></label><button class='primary'>Add summary model</button></form></details></section><section class='provider-section' aria-labelledby='compaction-heading'><h3 id='compaction-heading'>Memory Tree model</h3><p class='provider-description'>Zipper-style memory: recent turns stay verbatim at the focus, older history folds into fixed summary blocks that get coarser with distance. Opt in per DM; originals stay recallable in the Memory Tree.</p><form class='compaction-settings' method='post' action='/providers'><input type='hidden' name='action' value='compaction'><label class='summary-toggle'><input name='enabled' type='checkbox' checked><span><strong>Automatic summaries</strong><small>Use Control compaction for the DMs listed below.</small></span></label><div class='provider-fields'><label>Summary model<select name='model'><option value=''>Select a summary model</option><option value='qwen-agent'>qwen-agent</option><option value='summary-small' selected>summary-small</option><option value='claude-summary'>claude-summary</option></select></label><label>DMs to summarize<input name='chats' maxlength='8192' placeholder='c-example c-another' value='c-100-0 c-100-1'><small>Space-separated DM IDs. Empty means none.</small></label></div><details class='compaction-advanced'><summary>Advanced window settings</summary><div class='provider-fields'><label>Recent entries kept verbatim<input name='recent_entries' type='number' min='1' max='128' value='8'></label><label>Leaf chunk entries (power of two)<input name='leaf_entries' type='number' min='1' max='64' value='4'></label><label>History byte budget<input name='history_bytes' type='number' min='1024' max='262144' value='20000'></label></div><p class='provider-description'>Input is conservatively byte-bounded using declared context/output limits. Requests exceeding capacity fail visibly.</p></details><p class='provider-description'>Inspect and edit a DM's Memory Tree at <code>/dm/ID/memory</code>, or use <code>/compact</code> in the TUI.</p><div class='provider-actions'><button class='primary'>Save compaction settings</button></div></form></section></div><div class="bottom-note"><span>⌘ CONTROL</span></div></main></div>
</div>
</body></html>
